{"title":"BOLIDE","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover the luxurious world of the Datum Dahleez Bolide collection, where passion for precision and superior craftsmanship meets automotive excellence. Featuring stunning 1:18 and 1:24 scale model cars in striking blue and yellow finishes, each piece is a celebration of the legendary Datum Dahleez brand.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-bolide-scale-model-1-18-yellow","title":"Datum Dahleez BOLIDE SCALE MODEL 1:18 YELLOW","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:18 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in yellow (approx. 27cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344087720283,"sku":"11047Y","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m49_58c8cd9e-616f-48e2-9cca-767f3710c7b0.jpg?v=1742416426"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-bolide-scale-model-1-18-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez BOLIDE SCALE MODEL 1:18 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:18 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in blue (approx. 27cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088080731,"sku":"11047B","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m1_b4a52add-71a6-4115-b8c2-7c3a17861a31.jpg?v=1742416424"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-bolide-scale-model-1-24-yellow","title":"Datum Dahleez BOLIDE SCALE MODEL 1:24 YELLOW","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in yellow (approx. 14cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088310107,"sku":"M32911Y","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m45_1_13085651-781e-40a2-a4f7-10dbf5c9c0fb.jpg?v=1742416423"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-bolide-scale-model-1-24-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez BOLIDE SCALE MODEL 1:24 BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eA highly detailed 1:24 scale diecast model of the Datum Dahleez Bolide in blue (approx. 14cm). This replica beautifully recreates the bodywork of the car, with all curves and features exactly where you would find them on the original car.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344088670555,"sku":"M32911B","price":28.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/m41_1_95964dcd-bcdd-4c0f-bcaf-c14ac613a18a.jpg?v=1742416418"},{"product_id":"lego-technic-Datum Dahleez-bolide-blue-copy","title":"LEGO ®️ TECHNIC ™️ Datum Dahleez BOLIDE YELLOW","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe model car kit features a working W16 engine, steering and scissor doors. The stunning looks of the LEGO race car steal the show, with a yellow colour scheme and authentic sticker details. After building and exploring the car, kids (and adults alike) can display their collectible LEGO racing car with pride.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLEGO Technic model building sets feature realistic movement and mechanisms that introduce young LEGO builders to the universe of engineering in an approachable and realistic way. This LEGO sports car set makes a fab gift for kids aged 9 plus years old with a passion for race car toys and collectible model car kits.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50083277570395,"sku":"42151","price":50.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/legobolideyellow1.jpg?v=1742416134"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/bolide.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}